      "overview": "Jiang Cheng, the lead game designer, is unexpectedly pulled into the world of Ragnarök, the very game he created. There, he is forcibly bound to Su Ye, the final boss who has awakened self-awareness. Trapped together by a system-mandated mission, the two embark on a journey to repair their broken world.As creator and captive clash at every turn, they battle through bizarre dungeons, encounter mysterious system forces, and face off against rogue players. Along the way, long-buried secrets begin to surface, and the bond between them slowly transforms—through suspicion, resistance, and shared danger. But all the while, the apocalypse looms ever closer for every player in the game.",
